{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14941","headline":"奉陪侍中游石笋溪十二韵 · 卢纶","name":"奉陪侍中游石笋溪十二韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝日照灵山，山溪浩纷错。\n图书无旧记，鲧禹应新凿。\n双壁泻天河，一峰吐莲萼。\n潭心乱雪卷，嵓腹繁珠落。\n彩蛤攒锦囊，芳萝嫋花索。\n猨羣曝阳岭，龙穴腥阴壑。\n静得渔者言，闲闻洞仙博。\n欹松倚朱幰，广石屯油幕。\n国泰事留侯，山春纵康乐。\n间关殊状鸟，烂熳无名药。\n欲验少君方，还吟大隐作。\n旌幢不可驻，古塞新沙漠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14941.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14941","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}